  "title": {
    "zh": "三日传感器出勤证明",
    "en": "Three-Day Sensor Attendance"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "一个区域在头 3 天至少交出 3 条不同编号的有效温度，才有资格复核。先保留空值作为缺报证据，再统计有效读数。交出全部区域计数和过线名单。",
    "en": "An area qualifies for review with at least three distinct valid readings in the first three days. Preserve missing readings as evidence, count only valid readings, and deliver both the full tally and the qualifying areas."
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "记录去重、缺报保留与分组计数",
    "en": "Deduplication, missing-row evidence and valid counts"
  },
  "prerequisites": [
